<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Confirmez votre inscription</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#040A20; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#040A20; padding: 40px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="400" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#1F2833; border: 1px solid rgba(197,160,89,0.25); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 32px;">

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 24px;">
              <span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #C5A059; text-transform: uppercase;">
                GemLink
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 16px;">
              <span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #E2E2E9; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;">
                Bienvenue {{ username }}
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 32px;">
              <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #B7B7C2; margin: 0;">
                Merci de vous être inscrit sur GemLink. Confirmez votre adresse email pour activer votre compte et commencer à explorer la galerie de pierres.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 24px;">
              <a href="{{ validationUrl }}"
                style="display:inline-block; background-color: rgba(197,160,89,0.24); border: 1px solid rgba(197,160,89,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 32px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A059; text-decoration: none;">
                Confirmer mon email
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center">
              <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; color: #6B6B7A; margin: 0;">
                Ce lien expire dans 24 heures. Si vous n'avez pas créé de compte, ignorez cet email.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>